<article class="env-definition" id="08M0">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/08M0">Definition <span data-tag="08M0">7.43.7</span>.</a> Let $f : \mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits (\mathcal{D}) \to \mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits (\mathcal{C})$ be a morphism of topoi. </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
We say $f$ is an <em>open immersion</em> if $f$ is an embedding and the essential image of $f_*$ is an open subtopos. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
We say $f$ is a <em>closed immersion</em> if $f$ is an embedding and the essential image of $f_*$ is a closed subtopos. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</article>